      "core_meaning_cn": "感觉、触摸或摸起来；认为；触感与直觉",
      "core_meaning_en": "experience, touch, or feel to the touch; believe; feel or intuition",
      "mental_model_cn": "人feel happy是自身感觉；东西feels soft是摸起来的性质。feel that表达看法，feel like doing表示想做；名词既可指触感或氛围，也可指a feel for的直觉。feel for sth是摸索寻找，feel for sb是同情。",
